# FAQ sahifasi uchun tarjimalar - English

# Asosiy sarlavhalar
msgid "Ko'p So'raladigan Savollar"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni va TAMES tizimi haqida eng ko'p beriladigan savollarga javoblar"
msgstr "Answers to the most frequently asked questions about thyroid cancer and the TAMES system"

msgid "Savollar bo'yicha qidirish..."
msgstr "Search questions..."

# Kategoriyalar
msgid "Umumiy Ma'lumot"
msgstr "General Information"

msgid "Xavf Omillari"
msgstr "Risk Factors"

msgid "Turlari"
msgstr "Types"

msgid "Belgilar"
msgstr "Symptoms"

msgid "Diagnostika"
msgstr "Diagnosis"

msgid "Davolash"
msgstr "Treatment"

msgid "Yuqumlilik"
msgstr "Contagiousness"

msgid "Prognoz"
msgstr "Prognosis"

# Savollar
msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni nima?"
msgstr "What is thyroid cancer?"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni sabablari nima bo'lishi mumkin?"
msgstr "What are the causes of thyroid cancer?"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratonining turlari qanday?"
msgstr "What are the types of thyroid cancer?"

msgid "Kasallikning dastlabki belgilari qanday bo'ladi?"
msgstr "What are the early signs of the disease?"

msgid "Qanday qilib aniqlanadi (diagnostika)?"
msgstr "How is it diagnosed?"

msgid "Davolash qanday amalga oshiriladi?"
msgstr "How is treatment carried out?"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni yuqumlimi?"
msgstr "Is thyroid cancer contagious?"

msgid "Odam to'liq sog'ayib ketishi mumkinmi?"
msgstr "Can a person fully recover?"

# Javoblar - FAQ 1
msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni — bu bo'yinning old qismida joylashgan qalqonsimon bez hujayralarining nazoratsiz o'sishi natijasida paydo bo'ladigan o'sma kasalligidir."
msgstr "Thyroid cancer is a tumor disease that occurs as a result of uncontrolled growth of thyroid gland cells located in the front of the neck."

msgid "Muhim:"
msgstr "Important:"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez metabolizm va gormonlar ishlab chiqarishda muhim rol o'ynaydi. Bu bezning saratoni erta bosqichda aniqlanganida davolash samaradorligi yuqori."
msgstr "The thyroid gland plays an important role in metabolism and hormone production. Treatment effectiveness is high when thyroid cancer is detected at an early stage."

# FAQ 2
msgid "Asosiy xavf omillari:"
msgstr "Main risk factors:"

msgid "Irsi omillar (oila a'zolarida bo'lgan holatlar)"
msgstr "Hereditary factors (cases in family members)"

msgid "Radiatsiyaga ta'sirlanish (bolalikda nurlanish olgan bo'lish)"
msgstr "Radiation exposure (being irradiated in childhood)"

msgid "Gormon disbalansi yoki yod yetishmasligi"
msgstr "Hormonal imbalance or iodine deficiency"

msgid "Ba'zi genetik sindromlar (masalan, MEN 2 sindromi)"
msgstr "Some genetic syndromes (for example, MEN 2 syndrome)"

msgid "Ogohlantirish:"
msgstr "Warning:"

msgid "Agar oilangizda qalqonsimon bez kasalliklari bo'lgan bo'lsa, muntazam tekshiruvdan o'tishni tavsiya etamiz."
msgstr "If there have been thyroid diseases in your family, we recommend regular check-ups."

# FAQ 3
msgid "Eng ko'p uchraydigan turlari:"
msgstr "Most common types:"

msgid "Papillyar"
msgstr "Papillary"

msgid "eng keng tarqalgan, sekin o'sadi"
msgstr "most widespread, grows slowly"

msgid "Follikulyar"
msgstr "Follicular"

msgid "ikkinchi darajada keng tarqalgan"
msgstr "second most common"

msgid "Medullyar"
msgstr "Medullary"

msgid "kamroq uchraydi"
msgstr "less common"

msgid "Anaplastik"
msgstr "Anaplastic"

msgid "kam uchraydi, lekin agressiv kechadi"
msgstr "rare but aggressive"

msgid "Yaxshi xabar:"
msgstr "Good news:"

msgid "Papillyar va follikulyar turlarining davolash natijalari juda yaxshi, agar erta aniqlansa prognoz ijobiy."
msgstr "Treatment outcomes for papillary and follicular types are very good, prognosis is positive if detected early."

# FAQ 4
msgid "Asosiy simptomlar:"
msgstr "Main symptoms:"

msgid "Bo'yinda tugun yoki shish paydo bo'lishi"
msgstr "Appearance of a lump or swelling in the neck"

msgid "Yutishda yoki nafas olishda qiyinchilik"
msgstr "Difficulty swallowing or breathing"

msgid "Ovozda o'zgarish (xirillash)"
msgstr "Voice changes (hoarseness)"

msgid "Bo'yin og'rigi yoki noqulaylik"
msgstr "Neck pain or discomfort"

msgid "Ba'zida hech qanday simptom bo'lmasligi ham mumkin"
msgstr "Sometimes there may be no symptoms at all"

msgid "Agar bu belgilardan birortasini sezsangiz, darhol shifokorga murojaat qiling!"
msgstr "If you notice any of these signs, contact a doctor immediately!"

# FAQ 5
msgid "Diagnostika usullari:"
msgstr "Diagnostic methods:"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez UZI"
msgstr "Thyroid ultrasound"

msgid "Qon tahlillari (TSH, T3, T4, kalsitonin va h.k.)"
msgstr "Blood tests (TSH, T3, T4, calcitonin, etc.)"

msgid "Biopsiya (o'sma hujayralarini mikroskopda tekshirish)"
msgstr "Biopsy (microscopic examination of tumor cells)"

msgid "KT yoki MRT (kengaygan holatlarni aniqlash uchun)"
msgstr "CT or MRI (to detect advanced cases)"

msgid "Bizning sun'iy intellekt tizimimiz ultratovush rasmlari va laboratoriya ma'lumotlarini tahlil qilib, dastlabki tashxis berishda yordam beradi!"
msgstr "Our artificial intelligence system analyzes ultrasound images and laboratory data, helping to provide an initial diagnosis!"

# FAQ 6
msgid "Davolash usullari:"
msgstr "Treatment methods:"

msgid "Jarrohlik"
msgstr "Surgery"

msgid "bezni qisman yoki to'liq olib tashlash"
msgstr "partial or complete removal of the gland"

msgid "Radioaktiv yod bilan davolash"
msgstr "Radioactive iodine treatment"

msgid "qoldiq saraton hujayralarini yo'q qilish"
msgstr "destroying residual cancer cells"

msgid "Gormon terapiyasi"
msgstr "Hormone therapy"

msgid "TSH darajasini boshqarish uchun"
msgstr "to control TSH levels"

msgid "Kimyo- yoki nurlanish terapiyasi"
msgstr "Chemotherapy or radiation therapy"

msgid "ba'zi hollarda"
msgstr "in some cases"

msgid "Davolash rejasi individual bo'lib, kasallikning turi va bosqichiga qarab belgilanadi."
msgstr "The treatment plan is individual and is determined by the type and stage of the disease."

# FAQ 7
msgid "Yo'q!"
msgstr "No!"

msgid "Qalqonsimon bez saratoni yuqumli emas — ya'ni boshqalarga o'tmaydi."
msgstr "Thyroid cancer is not contagious — meaning it does not spread to others."

msgid "Saraton kasalliklari odamdan odamga yuqmaydi. Bu hujayralarning genetik o'zgarishlari natijasida yuzaga keladigan kasallikdir."
msgstr "Cancer diseases do not spread from person to person. This is a disease that occurs as a result of genetic changes in cells."

# FAQ 8
msgid "Ha!"
msgstr "Yes!"

msgid "Ko'pchilik bemorlar to'liq sog'ayib ketadi, ayniqsa papillyar va follikulyar turlarida. Erta bosqichda aniqlansa, prognoz juda yaxshi."
msgstr "Most patients fully recover, especially with papillary and follicular types. If detected at an early stage, the prognosis is very good."

msgid "Statistika:"
msgstr "Statistics:"

msgid "Papillyar saraton: 98% dan ortiq 5 yillik omon qolish"
msgstr "Papillary cancer: over 98% 5-year survival"

msgid "Follikulyar saraton: 95% dan ortiq 5 yillik omon qolish"
msgstr "Follicular cancer: over 95% 5-year survival"

msgid "Erta aniqlangan holatda: deyarli 100% davolanadi"
msgstr "When detected early: nearly 100% curable"

msgid "Maslahat:"
msgstr "Advice:"

msgid "Muntazam tekshiruvdan o'ting va shifokor tavsiyalariga rioya qiling!"
msgstr "Get regular check-ups and follow your doctor's recommendations!"

# CTA Section
msgid "TAMES AI Tizimi Bilan Tashxis"
msgstr "Diagnosis with TAMES AI System"

msgid "Sun'iy intellekt yordamida qalqonsimon bez xavfli o'smalarini professional baholash. Dastlabki tashxisni bir necha daqiqada oling!"
msgstr "Professional assessment of malignant thyroid tumors using artificial intelligence. Get a preliminary diagnosis in minutes!"

msgid "Tizim Haqida"
msgstr "About System"

# Contact Section
msgid "Savolingiz Qoldimi?"
msgstr "Have Questions?"

msgid "Biz bilan bog'laning va barcha savollaringizga javob olamiz"
msgstr "Contact us and get answers to all your questions"
